---
title: "vinit on a fresh project"
---
flowchart TD
    RUN([/viber init]):::run
    WHO[USERNAME asked]:::ask
    SCAN[Deck scanned · metadata only]:::step
    CLASS[Classified · Viber or Deck]:::step
    EXC[Exclusions asked · consequence stated]:::ask
    REG[registry.md]:::state
    MEM[Memory files]:::state
    GIT[gitignore duties]:::ask
    AG[AGENTS.md · Viber section]:::state
    CEN[census · serves doing why]:::state
    SURVEY[Outputs surveyed · Needs Review]:::step
    START([First step · idea-md]):::run

    RUN --> WHO --> SCAN --> CLASS --> EXC --> REG
    REG --> MEM --> GIT --> AG --> CEN --> SURVEY --> START

    subgraph AFTER[Every later session]
        direction TB
        READ[AGENTS.md read]:::step
        UMB[Umbrella · .viber knowledge]:::state
        ROUTE([Router guides · census + memory]):::run
        READ --> UMB --> ROUTE
    end
    START --> READ

    subgraph LEGEND [Legend]
        direction LR
        L1([run]):::run ~~~ L2([ask]):::ask ~~~ L3([state]):::state ~~~ L4([step]):::step
    end

    classDef run fill:#c7f0d8,stroke:#2c7a4b,color:#143a24
    classDef ask fill:#fde8c8,stroke:#b06a00,color:#4a2d00
    classDef state fill:#d8e8fb,stroke:#2b5fa3,color:#12294a
    classDef step fill:#efeade,stroke:#8a7a52,color:#3d3520
